LiquidationPeriphery::setSupportedMarket
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
├── when market is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when market borrow token does not match BORROW_TOKEN
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
└── when caller is owner and market borrow token matches BORROW_TOKEN
    ├── it should set supportedMarkets
    └── it should emit SupportedMarketSet
